  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "Senator Harry Reid, then Senate Majority Leader, read the researcher Robert Hastings's book UFOs and Nukes, about UFOs at nuclear weapons sites, and it was one reason he secretly arranged money for a hidden Pentagon UFO study in 2007, according to what the journalist George Knapp told Hastings. Hastings tells Michels about this, and in a piece dated January 11, 2024 he wrote that during a November 17, 2023 interview Knapp said Reid \"had once told him\" that the book's revelations \"regarding UFOs monitoring and even tampering with US nuclear missiles\" were one of the reasons for the funding. If so, the reports of UFOs at missile sites helped start the government's modern UFO study, though Hastings is passing on what Knapp says Reid said."
